&lt;h2 class=&quot;sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 ghXWGq custom-css-style-job-description&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Reporting Line:&lt;/strong&gt; Mission and Space Segment - Reporting to Lead Satellite Systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At constellr, we use thermal intelligence from space to understand what is happening on Earth - where, when and at scale. Our satellite constellation delivers high-resolution land surface temperature data, giving governments, defence organisations, commercial operators and global institutions the intelligence they need to monitor change, assess risk and make better-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From national security and critical infrastructure to agriculture and climate resilience, constellr turns temperature into actionable intelligence for a changing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW190054039 BCX0&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;You will join the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;constellr Mission &amp;amp; Space Segment team&lt;/strong&gt;, playing a key role in shaping the onboard software that powers our satellite constellation across its full lifecycle — from early design through to in-orbit operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
